<Slide padding={60} style={{ background: '#FFFFFF', fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei', flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 72, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', padding: 24, background: '#1E4FA8' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 34, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>选题依据 · 需求、技术与可验证性</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#CADCFC', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.2, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>02 · Topic</Text></Box><Box style={{ width: 1160, height: 1, background: '#E5E7EB' }}></Box><Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 497, flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ width: 1160, height: 372, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', gap: 20 }}><Box style={{ width: 640, flexDirection: 'column' }}><Image src="assets/architecture.png" style={{ width: 620, height: 316, objectFit: 'contain' }} /><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.3, margin: 0, marginTop: 8 }}>图 1  V1.5.0 系统架构：单一零依赖后端 · 8 张表 · 30 秒调度</Text></Box><Box style={{ width: 480, flexDirection: 'column', padding: 8 }}><Box style={{ width: 470, flexDirection: 'column' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 21, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>需求依据</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.5, margin: 0, marginTop: 6 }}>课程作业要求交付可运行系统与可验收文档；需求文档按 GB/T 9385-2008 口径编写。</Text></Box><Box style={{ width: 470, flexDirection: 'column', marginTop: 16 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 21, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>技术依据</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.5, margin: 0, marginTop: 6 }}>Python 标准库 ThreadingHTTPServer 单一 server.py + SQLite 8 张表；原生前端无构建，6 个 Provider 可插拔。</Text></Box><Box style={{ width: 470, flexDirection: 'column', marginTop: 16 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 21, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>验证依据</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.5, margin: 0, marginTop: 6 }}>A01 – A39 每条给出可判定条件；startup / demo / feature / study 四套回归与 JSON 证据可复核。</Text></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{ width: 1160, marginTop: 12 }}><Box style={{ width: 1160, height: 48, background: '#E8EFF8', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', padding: 16 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#1A2230', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.4, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>技术约束：一条 python server.py 即可启动，适配答辩机房与离线演示；未配置密钥时自动降级演示模式。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ width: 1160, height: 34, flexDirection: 'column', marginTop: 10 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1A2230', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.4, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>依据结论：选题不依赖外部商业服务，也不依赖专用硬件，具备在课程作业范围内做完并验明的条件。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 30, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.3, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>AI 校园学习陪伴助手  ·  课程作业答辩</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.3, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>08 / 28</Text></Box></Slide>